"drop-shadow-lg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5f/Btn_play.png/36px-Btn_play.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5f/Btn_play.png/48px-Btn_play.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"96\" data-file-height=\"96\" /></a></div></div>\n</td></tr>\n<tr style=\"font-size: 90%;\">\n<td style=\"padding: 0.5em 1em;\"><span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>达成条件：</b></span>要求达成过「于此如愿以偿」。完成事件「“致意亚琛”」，获得造物「“致意亚琛”」后，在小教堂面对瓦伦缇娜选择「握住瓦伦缇娜的手」。\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<table class=\"wikitable mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" style=\"width: 400px; max-width: 100%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th>感性满溢而出\n</th></tr>\n<tr style=\"position: relative;\">\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/ASD-08d\" title=\"ASD-08d\"><img alt=\"Rouge review chapter 11.png\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/c/c4/Rouge_review_chapter_11.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"393\" height=\"202\" class=\"img-fit\" data-file-width=\"393\" data-file-height=\"202\" /></a>\n<div style=\"position: absolute; right: 15%; bottom: 10%; text-align: right; width: 300px;\"><div class=\"serif\" style=\"font-size: 130%;\"><span style=\"vertical-align: bottom;\"><b>感性满溢而出</b></span><span style=\"user-select:none; padding-left:0\">&#160;</span><a href=\"/wiki/ASD-08d\" title=\"ASD-08d\"><img alt=\"Btn play.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5f/Btn_play.png/24px-Btn_play.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" class=\"drop-shadow-lg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5f/Btn_play.png/36px-Btn_play.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5f/Btn_play.png/48px-Btn_play.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"96\" data-file-height=\"96\" /></a></div></div>\n</td></tr>\n<tr style=\"font-size: 90%;\">\n<td style=\"padding: 0.5em 1em;\"><span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>达成条件：</b></span>要求达成过「于此如愿以偿」。完成事件「发狂的贵族」，获得造物「小螺号」后，在小教堂面对瓦伦缇娜选择「与两人同行」。\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n</div></di